# Title: Investigate a slow run
# Description: Select a slow step in Run Overview, compare What changed, review evidence, then inspect the same interval in Timeline and subsystem tools.
...@_style

direction: right
run: "Run Overview" {class: source}
comparison: "What changed?" {class: evidence}
candidate: "Evidence" {class: evidence}
timeline: "Timeline" {class: process}
detail: "Subsystem" {class: optional}
run -> comparison -> candidate -> timeline -> detail {style.stroke: "#6366f1"}
